OL,3,CDan Burn named Newcastle United captain
OL,5,FNewcastle United has announced that
OL,6,Fdefender Dan Burn has been appointed
OL,7,Fclub captain ahead of the 2026/27
OL,8,Fcampaign.
OL,10,FThe 34-year-old, who is an England
OL,11,Finternational and lifelong supporter
OL,12,Fof the Magpies, has described the new
OL,13,Frole as an "absolute honour".
OL,15,FHe replaces Bruno Guimaraes, who had
OL,16,Fbeen the team captain for the last two
OL,17,Fseasons, but left Newcastle for
OL,18,FArsenal earlier this month.
OL,26,@wD@Ytp
