OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786965501
OL,3,CDan Burn named Newcastle United captain
OL,5,FBurn is the club's fourth-highest
OL,6,Fappearance maker within the current
OL,7,Fsquad and has 11 England caps to his
OL,8,Fname, including three at this summer's
OL,9,FFIFA World Cup.
OL,11,FHe said: "It's always an immense
OL,12,Fprivilege to represent this football
OL,13,Fclub, especially when I have been
OL,14,Ftrusted with the armband on previous
OL,15,Foccasions, but to lead the team on a
OL,16,Fpermanent basis is going to be really
OL,17,Fspecial.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
