PN,39203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786965501
OL,3,CDan Burn named Newcastle United captain
OL,5,F"It's been an incredible journey since
OL,6,FI joined the club four-and-a-half
OL,7,Fyears ago ` we've achieved some
OL,8,Famazing things together and enjoyed
OL,9,Fsome unforgettable moments.
OL,11,F"I believe there's still more to come
OL,12,Fand I'm relishing the responsibility
OL,13,Fof pushing everybody every single day
OL,14,Fto make sure that is the case."
OL,16,FBurn was handed the role by Newcastle
OL,17,FUnited's new head coach Matthias
OL,18,FJaissle, who described him as a
OL,19,F"natural leader".
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
