CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1786965501
OL,3,CDan Burn named Newcastle United captain
OL,5,FJaissle added: "He puts the interests
OL,6,Fof the team ahead of his own every
OL,7,Ftime he steps onto the pitch and
OL,8,Falways gives maximum commitment in
OL,9,Feverything he does.
OL,11,F"Off the pitch, he leads by example in
OL,12,Fhow he conducts himself. Not many
OL,13,Fpeople understand what this club means
OL,14,Fto the city better than Dan and that
OL,15,Fexperience will be vital in helping
OL,16,Fguide our younger players through this
OL,17,Fperiod of change and adaptation."
